{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403550/extras/c77c141c9840b264beea4b5a934a7607.avif?t=1760637284\" width=616 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deeply grieved by his wife's death, Chris is completely devastated when his son also disappears without a trace.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >His search for his son Cedric quickly turns into a surreal adventure filled with shadows, secrets, and supernatural forces. Strange symbols, forgotten places, and unexplained events begin to surface, dragging Chris into a world where logic breaks down and nothing is as it seems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why did Cedric disappear? What is the great secret behind his disappearance?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This dramatic journey, where love, time, darkness, and light coexist, will uncover all the hidden and unknown truths.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore the World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore towns, forests, hospitals, caves, houses, mazes, underground shelters, hidden areas, restaurants, shops, and many other locations\u2014interact with people to uncover clues and progress through the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403550/extras/9372a21891a91e0a3a9c2f5f6fda8f6a.poster.avif?t=1760637284\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403550/extras/9372a21891a91e0a3a9c2f5f6fda8f6a.webm?t=1760637284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403550/extras/9372a21891a91e0a3a9c2f5f6fda8f6a.mp4?t=1760637284\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>While exploring caves, you might have to fight a bear or break through rocks to move forward!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Be prepared for all kinds of challenges on your journey to find Cedric.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sometimes, you may even need to bring a fish to a restaurant owner just to get a clue!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403550/extras/86e43fd8d3ef6ab8714846fea946aa57.poster.avif?t=1760637284\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403550/extras/86e43fd8d3ef6ab8714846fea946aa57.webm?t=1760637284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403550/extras/86e43fd8d3ef6ab8714846fea946aa57.mp4?t=1760637284\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mini-Games</strong><br>You can trigger some very interesting scenes by interacting with certain objects!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes, you\u2019ll need to play a console game or connect electrical wires to progress through the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403550/extras/12d40a79a3893ea95b17e3475b9c535a.poster.avif?t=1760637284\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403550/extras/12d40a79a3893ea95b17e3475b9c535a.webm?t=1760637284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403550/extras/12d40a79a3893ea95b17e3475b9c535a.mp4?t=1760637284\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And that's not all\u2014many more surprise mini-games are waiting for you throughout the narrative!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A dramatic and surprising story...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Chris searches for his son Cedric, the past and future will intertwine in unexpected ways, leading to emotional and heartfelt moments throughout the journey.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403550/extras/6742fdbcb0e76fb24580581d73f26979.poster.avif?t=1760637284\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403550/extras/6742fdbcb0e76fb24580581d73f26979.webm?t=1760637284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403550/extras/6742fdbcb0e76fb24580581d73f26979.mp4?t=1760637284\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Message from the game developer:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character cards, the option to play in 11 languages, mazes, puzzles, and many more features I can't even begin to describe are waiting for you in this adventure. You might even have to build something sometimes!?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not just a game for me; it is life itself. All our sorrows, joys, dreams\u2026 In short, all the emotions we experience are brought to life within this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I am Deniz Yukar\u0131\u00e7ukur, the creator of this game. I am also a father\u2014the father of a 3-year-old daughter\u2014and I am married. I tried to reflect everything I\u2019ve felt in real life into this game as much as I could.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, I also included things we\u2019ve always wondered about but never had the chance to experience in real life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I hope you enjoy this game. I\u2019d be very happy if you add it to your wishlist to help this small but sincere community grow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403550/extras/9c5cc65d73b76eeda1a468f1a07aac2a.avif?t=1760637284\" width=616 height=212 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2403550?t=1760637284","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403550/96d2e7894218a4c302a3e404a6e6fecc323c5abb/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760637284","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403550/2fcfa4e9354f6d7ce6f21a59dfd6cb735103ecfc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760637284","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403550/2fcfa4e9354f6d7ce6f21a59dfd6cb735103ecfc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760637284","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3947000,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403550/extras/c77c141c9840b264beea4b5a934a7607.avif?t=1760637284\" width=616 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deeply grieved by his wife's death, Chris is completely devastated when his son also disappears without a trace.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >His search for his son Cedric quickly turns into a surreal adventure filled with shadows, secrets, and supernatural forces. Strange symbols, forgotten places, and unexplained events begin to surface, dragging Chris into a world where logic breaks down and nothing is as it seems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why did Cedric disappear? What is the great secret behind his disappearance?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This dramatic journey, where love, time, darkness, and light coexist, will uncover all the hidden and unknown truths.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore the World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore towns, forests, hospitals, caves, houses, mazes, underground shelters, hidden areas, restaurants, shops, and many other locations\u2014interact with people to uncover clues and progress through the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403550/extras/9372a21891a91e0a3a9c2f5f6fda8f6a.poster.avif?t=1760637284\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403550/extras/9372a21891a91e0a3a9c2f5f6fda8f6a.webm?t=1760637284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403550/extras/9372a21891a91e0a3a9c2f5f6fda8f6a.mp4?t=1760637284\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>While exploring caves, you might have to fight a bear or break through rocks to move forward!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Be prepared for all kinds of challenges on your journey to find Cedric.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sometimes, you may even need to bring a fish to a restaurant owner just to get a clue!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><